{"seq":3,"slug":"dynamic-components","title":"动态组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/component-design/dynamic-components","wordCount":505,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"动态组件\">动态组件</h1><h2 id=\"组件动态切换\">组件动态切换</h2><p>Vue 提供了 <code>&lt;component :is&gt;</code> 内置指令来实现组件的动态渲染，配合 <code>&lt;KeepAlive&gt;</code>、异步组件和 <code>&lt;Suspense&gt;</code> 可以构建高效灵活的界面。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    IS[&quot;component :is&quot;]&#10;    IS --&gt; KA[&quot;KeepAlive(缓存)&quot;]&#10;    IS --&gt; AC[&quot;异步组件(懒加载)&quot;]&#10;    AC --&gt; SP[&quot;Suspense(加载状态)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    IS[\"component :is\"]\n    IS --&gt; KA[\"KeepAlive(缓存)\"]\n    IS --&gt; AC[\"异步组件(懒加载)\"]\n    AC --&gt; SP[\"Suspense(加载状态)\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>动态组件</strong>：<code>&lt;component :is&gt;</code> 依据变量在运行时决定渲染哪个组件。</li>\n<li><strong>组件复用 vs 组件切换</strong>：切换会销毁旧实例，<code>&lt;KeepAlive&gt;</code> 则缓存实例以保留其内部状态。</li>\n<li><strong>实例缓存策略</strong>：<code>include</code> / <code>exclude</code> 按组件名筛选，<code>max</code> 以 LRU 限制缓存规模。</li>\n<li><strong>异步组件</strong>：<code>defineAsyncComponent</code> 把组件拆成按需加载的代码块，支持 loading / error / timeout / 重试。</li>\n<li><strong>Suspense</strong>：协调异步组件树的就绪状态，在 <code>#fallback</code> 与 <code>#default</code> 之间切换。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"component-is\">component :is</h2><p><code>&lt;component :is&gt;</code> 根据传入的组件名或组件对象动态渲染不同组件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { ref, shallowRef, type Component } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;import TabHome from &#39;./TabHome.vue&#39;;&#10;import TabProfile from &#39;./TabProfile.vue&#39;;&#10;import TabSettings from &#39;./TabSettings.vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface Tab {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  label: string;&#10;  component: Component;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const tabs: Tab[] = [&#10;  { name: &#39;home&#39;, label: &#39;首页&#39;, component: TabHome },&#10;  { name: &#39;profile&#39;, label: &#39;个人资料&#39;, component: TabProfile },&#10;  { name: &#39;settings&#39;, label: &#39;设置&#39;, component: TabSettings },&#10;];&#10;&#10;const activeTab = shallowRef&lt;Component&gt;(TabHome);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;div class=&quot;tabs&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;button&#10;      v-for=&quot;tab in tabs&quot;&#10;      :key=&quot;tab.name&quot;&#10;      :class=&quot;{ active: activeTab === tab.component }&quot;&#10;      @click=&quot;activeTab = tab.component&quot;&#10;    &gt;&#10;      {{ tab.label }}&#10;    &lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;component :is=&quot;activeTab&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { ref, shallowRef, type Component } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import TabHome from './TabHome.vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import TabProfile from './TabProfile.vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import TabSettings from './TabSettings.vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Tab {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  label: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  component: Component;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const tabs: Tab[] = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  { name: 'home', label: '首页', component: TabHome },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  { name: 'profile', label: '个人资料', component: TabProfile },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  { name: 'settings', label: '设置', component: TabSettings },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const activeTab = shallowRef&#x3C;Component>(TabHome);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;div class=\"tabs\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;button</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      v-for=\"tab in tabs\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      :key=\"tab.name\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      :class=\"{ active: activeTab === tab.component }\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      @click=\"activeTab = tab.component\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {{ tab.label }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;component :is=\"activeTab\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>shallowRef</code> 存储组件引用，避免 <code>reactive</code> 对组件对象进行不必要的深层代理。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"keepalive\">KeepAlive</h2><p>默认情况下，切换 <code>&lt;component :is&gt;</code> 时旧组件会被销毁。<code>&lt;KeepAlive&gt;</code> 可以缓存非活跃组件实例，保留其状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;KeepAlive&gt;&#10;    &lt;component :is=&quot;activeTab&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;/KeepAlive&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;KeepAlive></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;component :is=\"activeTab\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/KeepAlive></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"缓存控制\">缓存控制</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>include</code></td>\n<td>只缓存匹配的组件</td>\n<td><code>include=&quot;TabHome,TabProfile&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exclude</code></td>\n<td>排除匹配的组件</td>\n<td><code>exclude=&quot;TabSettings&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max</code></td>\n<td>最大缓存实例数（LRU）</td>\n<td><code>max=&quot;5&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const includeList = ref&lt;string[]&gt;([&#39;TabHome&#39;, &#39;TabProfile&#39;]);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;KeepAlive :include=&quot;includeList&quot; :max=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;component :is=&quot;activeTab&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;/KeepAlive&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { ref } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const includeList = ref&#x3C;string[]>(['TabHome', 'TabProfile']);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;KeepAlive :include=\"includeList\" :max=\"10\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;component :is=\"activeTab\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/KeepAlive></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"keepalive-生命周期\">KeepAlive 生命周期</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant User as 用户&#10;    participant KA as KeepAlive&#10;    participant A as 组件 A&#10;    participant B as 组件 B&#10;&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;KA: 切换到 B&#10;    KA-&gt;&gt;A: onDeactivated(缓存)&#10;    KA-&gt;&gt;B: onActivated(激活/首次挂载)&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;KA: 切回 A&#10;    KA-&gt;&gt;B: onDeactivated(缓存)&#10;    KA-&gt;&gt;A: onActivated(从缓存恢复)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant KA as KeepAlive\n    participant A as 组件 A\n    participant B as 组件 B\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;KA: 切换到 B\n    KA-&gt;&gt;A: onDeactivated(缓存)\n    KA-&gt;&gt;B: onActivated(激活/首次挂载)\n    User-&gt;&gt;KA: 切回 A\n    KA-&gt;&gt;B: onDeactivated(缓存)\n    KA-&gt;&gt;A: onActivated(从缓存恢复)</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { onActivated, onDeactivated } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;onActivated(() =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;组件被激活，刷新数据&#39;);&#10;  fetchLatestData();&#10;});&#10;&#10;onDeactivated(() =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;组件被缓存，暂停轮询&#39;);&#10;  stopPolling();&#10;});&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { onActivated, onDeactivated } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onActivated(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log('组件被激活，刷新数据');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fetchLatestData();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onDeactivated(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log('组件被缓存，暂停轮询');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  stopPolling();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"异步组件\">异步组件</h2><p>使用 <code>defineAsyncComponent</code> 实现组件的懒加载，减小初始包体积：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { defineAsyncComponent } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const AsyncDashboard = defineAsyncComponent(() =&gt; import(&#39;./Dashboard.vue&#39;));&#10;&#10;const AsyncChart = defineAsyncComponent({&#10;  loader: () =&gt; import(&#39;./HeavyChart.vue&#39;),&#10;  loadingComponent: LoadingSpinner,&#10;  errorComponent: ErrorDisplay,&#10;  delay: 200,&#10;  timeout: 10000,&#10;  onError(error, retry, fail, attempts) {&#10;    if (attempts &lt;= 3) {&#10;      retry();&#10;    } else {&#10;      fail();&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineAsyncComponent } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> AsyncDashboard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineAsyncComponent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./Dashboard.vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> AsyncChart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineAsyncComponent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  loader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./HeavyChart.vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  loadingComponent: LoadingSpinner,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  errorComponent: ErrorDisplay,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  delay: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  timeout: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">attempts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (attempts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      fail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>loader</code></td>\n<td>加载函数</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>loadingComponent</code></td>\n<td>加载中显示的组件</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>errorComponent</code></td>\n<td>加载失败显示的组件</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>delay</code></td>\n<td>显示 loading 前的延迟</td>\n<td>200ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>timeout</code></td>\n<td>超时时间</td>\n<td>Infinity</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"suspense\">Suspense</h2><p><code>&lt;Suspense&gt;</code> 是 Vue 3 的内置组件，用于协调异步组件树的加载状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;Suspense&gt;&#10;    &lt;template #default&gt;&#10;      &lt;AsyncDashboard /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/template&gt;&#10;    &lt;template #fallback&gt;&#10;      &lt;div class=&quot;loading&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;LoadingSpinner /&gt;&#10;        &lt;p&gt;加载中...&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;/template&gt;&#10;  &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;template #default></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;AsyncDashboard /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;template #fallback></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div class=\"loading\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;LoadingSpinner /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;p>加载中...&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"suspense-事件\">Suspense 事件</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;Suspense @pending=&quot;onPending&quot; @resolve=&quot;onResolve&quot; @fallback=&quot;onFallback&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;AsyncPage /&gt;&#10;    &lt;template #fallback&gt;&#10;      &lt;LoadingSkeleton /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/template&gt;&#10;  &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Suspense @pending=\"onPending\" @resolve=\"onResolve\" @fallback=\"onFallback\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;AsyncPage /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;template #fallback></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;LoadingSkeleton /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    S[&quot;Suspense&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; |异步组件未就绪| F[&quot;#fallback 插槽&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; |异步组件就绪| D[&quot;#default 插槽&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; |&quot;@pending 事件&quot;| E1[&quot;处理加载状态&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; |&quot;@resolve 事件&quot;| E2[&quot;加载完成&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    S[\"Suspense\"]\n    S --&gt; |异步组件未就绪| F[\"#fallback 插槽\"]\n    S --&gt; |异步组件就绪| D[\"#default 插槽\"]\n    F --&gt; |\"@pending 事件\"| E1[\"处理加载状态\"]\n    D --&gt; |\"@resolve 事件\"| E2[\"加载完成\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"组合使用\">组合使用</h2><p>将动态组件、KeepAlive、异步组件和 Suspense 结合使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { shallowRef, defineAsyncComponent, type Component } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const tabs: Record&lt;string, Component&gt; = {&#10;  overview: defineAsyncComponent(() =&gt; import(&#39;./TabOverview.vue&#39;)),&#10;  analytics: defineAsyncComponent(() =&gt; import(&#39;./TabAnalytics.vue&#39;)),&#10;  reports: defineAsyncComponent(() =&gt; import(&#39;./TabReports.vue&#39;)),&#10;};&#10;&#10;const currentTab = shallowRef&lt;string&gt;(&#39;overview&#39;);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;nav&gt;&#10;    &lt;button v-for=&quot;(_, name) in tabs&quot; :key=&quot;name&quot; @click=&quot;currentTab = name&quot;&gt;&#10;      {{ name }}&#10;    &lt;/button&gt;&#10;  &lt;/nav&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;KeepAlive :max=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;Suspense :key=&quot;currentTab&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;component :is=&quot;tabs[currentTab]&quot; /&gt;&#10;      &lt;template #fallback&gt;&#10;        &lt;p&gt;加载中...&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;/template&gt;&#10;    &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;  &lt;/KeepAlive&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { shallowRef, defineAsyncComponent, type Component } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const tabs: Record&#x3C;string, Component> = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  overview: defineAsyncComponent(() => import('./TabOverview.vue')),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  analytics: defineAsyncComponent(() => import('./TabAnalytics.vue')),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  reports: defineAsyncComponent(() => import('./TabReports.vue')),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const currentTab = shallowRef&#x3C;string>('overview');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;nav></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;button v-for=\"(_, name) in tabs\" :key=\"name\" @click=\"currentTab = name\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {{ name }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/nav></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;KeepAlive :max=\"5\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Suspense :key=\"currentTab\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;component :is=\"tabs[currentTab]\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;template #fallback></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;p>加载中...&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/KeepAlive></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>&lt;component :is&gt;</code> 根据变量动态渲染不同组件，用 <code>shallowRef</code> 存储组件引用</li>\n<li><code>&lt;KeepAlive&gt;</code> 缓存非活跃组件实例，支持 <code>include</code>/<code>exclude</code>/<code>max</code> 缓存策略</li>\n<li>被缓存的组件使用 <code>onActivated</code>/<code>onDeactivated</code> 生命周期管理资源</li>\n<li><code>defineAsyncComponent</code> 实现组件懒加载，支持加载/错误/超时/重试配置</li>\n<li><code>&lt;Suspense&gt;</code> 协调异步组件的加载状态，提供 <code>#fallback</code> 显示加载中内容</li>\n<li>四者组合使用可构建高性能、用户体验良好的动态界面</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动态组件","id":"动态组件"},{"level":2,"text":"组件动态切换","id":"组件动态切换"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"component :is","id":"component-is"},{"level":2,"text":"KeepAlive","id":"keepalive"},{"level":3,"text":"缓存控制","id":"缓存控制"},{"level":3,"text":"KeepAlive 生命周期","id":"keepalive-生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"异步组件","id":"异步组件"},{"level":2,"text":"Suspense","id":"suspense"},{"level":3,"text":"Suspense 事件","id":"suspense-事件"},{"level":2,"text":"组合使用","id":"组合使用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"插槽与渲染函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/component-design/slots-and-render-functions"},"next":{"title":"Teleport 与 Suspense","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/component-design/teleport-and-suspense"}}